by its U.S.-only plug. For charging multiple devices, the Satechi 145W USB-C 4-Port GaN Travel Charger offers four ports, international adapters, and enough power for an iPhone, laptop, and additional phones, although it is expensive and heavy. Apple\u2019s 30W adapter serves as a benchmark but offers no major advantage beyond branding. Testing used an iPhone 16 Pro Max, standardized cables, and real-world use. Buyers should consider wattage, portability, number of ports, and intended use; GaN chargers provide efficient, cooler, compact power delivery.","ref_id":{"turn_index":525619,"ref_type":"news","ref_index":12},"pub_date":1776948486.0,"result_type":"news","thumbnail_url":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-1/9HYWcSlgykPRfF9eiSs-EXrLSWM4fNpJ8fizAZNwQTn8Vtk-E55qY9XZT0iYWiG_7W6utzH-gTe3MlNhJdgvXlC8abig9dj-VTc4TfE0M1fXFgGA75uLjE-b8wDnEqpC","attribution":"www.tomsguide.com"}]},{"type":"search_result_group","domain":"techwisereviews.com","entries":[{"type":"search_result","url":"https://techwisereviews.com/posts/best-gan-usb-c-chargers-travel-2026","title":"Best GaN USB-C Chargers for Travel (2026) \u00b7 TechWise","snippet":"","ref_id":{"turn_index":525619,"ref_type":"search","ref_index":6},"pub_date":1789689600.0,"result_type":"web","attribution":"techwisereviews.com"}]},{"type":"search_result_group","domain":"www.techwisereviews.com","entries":[{"type":"search_result","url":"https://www.techwisereviews.com/posts/best-gan-usb-c-chargers-travel-2026","title":"Best GaN USB-C Chargers for Travel (2026) \u00b7 TechWise","snippet":"","ref_id":{"turn_index":525619,"ref_type":"search","ref_index":7},"pub_date":1789689600.0,"result_type":"web","attribution":"www.techwisereviews.com"},{"type":"search_result","url":"https://www.techwisereviews.com/posts/best-usb-c-chargers-travel-multiple-devices-2026","title":"Best USB-C chargers for travelling with multiple devices in 2026 \u00b7 TechWise","snippet":"","ref_id":{"turn_index":525619,"ref_type":"search","ref_index":9},"pub_date":1787961600.0,"result_type":"web","attribution":"www.techwisereviews.com"}]},{"type":"search_result_group","domain":"www.technobezz.com","entries":[{"type":"search_result","url":"https://www.technobezz.com/best/best-multi-port-wall-chargers-u3c","title":"Best Multi-Port Wall Chargers for 2026 | Technobezz","snippet":"","ref_id":{"turn_index":525619,"ref_type":"search","ref_index":8},"pub_date":1778630400.0,"result_type":"web","source_name":"Technobezz","attribution":"www.technobezz.com"}]},{"type":"search_result_group","domain":"thisusb.com","entries":[{"type":"search_result","url":"https://thisusb.com/guides/best-travel-charger","title":"Best Travel Chargers in 2026: GaN Chargers and Universal Adapters | thisUSB","snippet":"","ref_id":{"turn_index":525619,"ref_type":"search","ref_index":10},"pub_date":1793664000.0,"result_type":"web","attribution":"thisusb.com"}]},{"type":"search_result_group","domain":"www.androidauthority.com","entries":[{"type":"search_result","url":"https://www.androidauthority.com/i-tested-over-30-usb-c-wall-chargers-3496950/","title":"The best USB-C chargers 2026: 30+ wall chargers tested and compared!","snippet":"","ref_id":{"turn_index":525619,"ref_type":"search","ref_index":11},"pub_date":1764201600.0,"result_type":"web","source_name":"Android Authority","attribution":"www.androidauthority.com"}]},{"type":"search_result_group","domain":"www.androidcentral.com","entries":[{"type":"search_result","url":"https://www.androidcentral.com/accessories/power-charging/best-usb-adapter-for-travel","title":"Best USB adapter for travel in 2026","snippet":"The article recommends the Baseus EnerCore CG11 Universal Travel Adapter as the best overall USB travel adapter for 2026. It offers interchangeable US, EU, UK, and AU plugs compatible with more than 200 countries, 70W USB-C PD 3.0 charging, one USB-C port, two USB-A ports, and a retractable 2.2-foot USB-C cable. Other highlighted options include the 75W Epicka TA-105 Max for maximum power, UGREEN\u2019s compact 65W Nexode with sturdy swappable plugs, Anker\u2019s flat 20W Nano adapter for tight spaces, TESSAN\u2019s 35W model with a built-in cable, and Acer\u2019s inexpensive 28W entry-level adapter. The guide advises choosing based on device needs: lower wattage is sufficient for phones and accessories, while laptops, tablets, and Chromebooks generally require at least 65W. A 65W\u201370W adapter is presented as the safest choice for most travelers. The Baseus model is especially recommended for its GaN design, efficient heat management, multiple ports, broad compatibility, and discounted price of approximately $35\u2013$40.","ref_id":{"turn_index":525619,"ref_type":"news","ref_index":13},"pub_date":1780343834.0,"result_type":"news","thumbnail_url":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-1/tOh3dHRqhT4VubXpraea3xMWbuiU7WXj0gnL5qKb9r23qzwg8bWCKABnyZy1pNTa9slthogPY1d4-J0QdWSVY4-dKgrXsqJpPwiLi6VV5e3racb7Xf-sbcRSb2GMOPLu","attribution":"www.androidcentral.com"}]},{"type":"search_result_group","domain":"www.techradar.com","entries":[{"type":"search_result","url":"https://www.techradar.com/phones/phone-accessories/ive-been-hunting-for-the-best-travel-charging-gadgets-to-avoid-low-battery-stress-on-vacation-here-are-my-top-recommendations","title":"I've been hunting for the best travel charging gadgets to avoid low-battery stress on vacation - here are my top recommendations","snippet":"This TechRadar guide recommends travel charging gadgets designed to prevent low-battery problems while on vacation. The selection includes multi-port wall chargers for hotel rooms with limited outlets, portable power banks for charging while sightseeing, Apple-focused wireless charging pads, MagSafe-compatible batteries, and high-output charging stations for remote work. Featured products include an overall favorite with four ports and fast charging; a premium compact unit combining a wireless pad, USB-C port, and built-in cable; chargers with retractable USB-C cables; a foldable three-device Apple charger supporting iPhone, AirPods, and Apple Watch; and a compact power bank with a retractable cable and attachment loop. An Anker MagSafe power bank is highlighted for its strong magnetic grip and fast charging, while a 200W, six-port station is recommended for laptops and tablets. A lightweight Qi2 magnetic charger is also suggested for users with a single MagSafe device. The article includes a comparison table and links to separate wireless charger and power bank guides.","ref_id":{"turn_index":525619,"ref_type":"news","ref_index":14},"pub_date":1784029046.0,"result_type":"news","thumbnail_url":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-1/8yEMiQ4nJ5dPlPpbGJLg9wdd8WazlDh6SVj_1pTsR2_4rl9r98mqFwMEVsJbSNJ2RMIG9q28n30Ea9lLPKtkb-zqv_uqYxEaX9JFFXJYe390N8WO9eV-YvWyG53Z5U78","attribution":"www.techradar.com"}]}],"source_message_ids":["8248abe7-71ea-4399-9dca-8272b565bcf6","68201573-62b5-4813-9a31-e84aa6b74891","fab0f181-5d45-445a-8cbe-52a76c9c9183"]},"reasoning_status":"is_reasoning","tool_summary_type":"web","tool_icons":["https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=www.earthsims.com&sz=128","https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=www.harvardapparatusregen.com&sz=128","https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=techsciencereview.com&sz=128","https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=dealectric.com&sz=128","https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=voyagehacks.com&sz=128","https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=www.wired.com&sz=128","https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=www.tomsguide.com&sz=128","https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=techwisereviews.com&sz=128","https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=www.techwisereviews.com&sz=128","https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=www.technobezz.com&sz=128","https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=thisusb.com&sz=128","https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=www.androidauthority.com&sz=128","https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=www.androidcentral.com&sz=128","https://www.google.com/s2/favicon